---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Container from "../components/Container.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="An architect's perspective on enterprise AI: what I work on, why, and how I think about the next decade of transformation."
>
  <Container as="article">
    <div style="margin-top:72px;">
      <p class="label" style="margin-bottom:12px;">About</p>
      <h1 class="h-page">
        I help organisations build AI systems that survive contact with reality.
      </h1>
    </div>

    <div class="prose" style="margin-top:28px; font-size:18px; line-height:1.6;">
      <p>
        I'm <strong>Aleksandrs Graholskis</strong>, an enterprise AI architect
        working with senior transformation leaders, CIOs, and governance
        functions in mid-to-large organisations across Europe.
      </p>
      <p>
        My focus is the part of the AI lifecycle most teams skip: the
        architecture that decides whether a successful prototype becomes a
        production system or quietly accumulates as <strong>AI debt</strong>.
        Shadow assistants, ungoverned RAG pipelines, agentic workflows built on
        assumptions no one wrote down. The cost compounds silently until
        something visible breaks.
      </p>
      <p>
        I work end-to-end on this: AI debt assessment, governance design
        aligned to the EU AI Act, reference architectures for retrieval and
        agentic systems, and the operating model that keeps the whole thing
        maintainable past the launch press release.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <p class="label" style="margin-bottom:12px;">Currently</p>
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="card"><p style="margin:0;">Agentic workflows for procurement and operations</p></div>
        <div class="card"><p style="margin:0;">Open to a small number of advisory engagements in 2026</p></div>
        <div class="card"><p style="margin:0;">Based between Riga and Copenhagen</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:44px;">
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </Container>
</BaseLayout>
